text I stare blankly up at the ceiling.
text Nagisa and I are sleeping side-by-side on the same futon.
text Our arms just barely touch each other.
sound O03.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text We're like a married couple.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's because we are.
sound O04.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Ah, you're right... Ehehe.
music BGM08D.mp3
text She seems happy.
text Nagisa must have just wanted to do something that made it truly feel like we have this kind of relationship.
text There doesn't seem to be any deeper meaning in her actions.
text That's why I'm not nervous as I hold her hand tight.
text She returns my grip.
sound O05.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text We worked hard for a year after that day.
text @[Tomoya]
text You're right...
sound O06.aac
