text @[Tomoya]
text Oh... Yeah, you're right.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm sure many things are waiting for us ahead. Difficult, painful, sad things.
sound O0B.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I can face them as long as I'm with you, Tomoya-kun.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. Let's keep moving forward, together.
sound O0C.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay.
text Nagisa really has become stronger.
text Thinking back to when we met two years ago...
text All I can remember is Nagisa's face, steeped in anxiety.
sound O0D.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text What are you laughing about?
text Nagisa looks in my direction.
text @[Tomoya]
