text Worried, I answer the phone.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hello?
sound O3O.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Hey, if it isn't my stupid son."
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, what is it?
sound O3P.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Nagisa started her job today, right?"
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, and?
sound O3Q.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Well, actually... There's been a rumor about her going around that reached me."
music ~
text ...A rumor.
text I don't like the sound of that.
text @[Tomoya]
text Like what...?
music BGM08A.mp3
sound O3R.aac
text @[Akio]
text "That she's absolutely adorable in that family restaurant uniform!"
text *WHOOMP*
text I fall over in front of the phone.
sound O3S.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Every single person who comes by the store is telling me."
sound O3T.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Doesn't it make you curious?"
text @[Tomoya]
text Why don't you go see her?
sound O3U.aac
text @[Akio]
text "You think I could do something that embarrassing, you idiot?!"
text @[Tomoya]
text Just do it.
sound O3V.aac
text @[Akio]
text "So anyway, send me some pictures."
text @[Tomoya]
text Who's gonna take them...?
sound O3W.aac
text @[Akio]
text "You."
text @[Tomoya]
text Like I have time to do that.
sound O3X.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Just take a day off work."
text @[Tomoya]
text I'd get fired if I did that.
sound O3Y.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Geez, sorry."
text @[Tomoya]
text So you want me to get fired?!
sound O3Z.aac
text @[Akio]
text "Okay, my dutiful son. I'm counting on you."
text *Click* *Beeeep-beeeep*
text ...He hung up.
